{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"499170","name":"沉星之序","title":"沉星之序","type":"game","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/499170/extras/82ae986439e91d65984fbf3a96c4fe18.avif?t=1795262597\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >传奇制作人 “吹哥” Jonathan Blow（代表作：《时空幻境》《见证者》）携新作《沉星之序》重磅归来。这款宏大的冒险游戏内含 1000 多个手工设计的谜题，旨在考验你的智慧极限。你将踏入充满奇异魔法、危险机关与凶残怪物的异界，探索四个机制迥异、角色鲜明、故事独立的平行世界，最终见证它们彼此交汇碰撞的壮丽景象。随着世界融合、角色相遇，谜题系统也将相互交织，催生出意想不到的全新玩法。按自己的节奏自由探索，随时重返各个世界与挑战。解锁独特的可操作角色，掌握不断演变的游戏机制，逐步剥开这片广阔互联世界的深层秘密。融合探索、叙事与持续蜕变的机制，《沉星之序》将为你呈现一场前所未有、充满生命力的谜境之旅。  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/499170/extras/23198eba49b798aed32c65408bb910fe.avif?t=1795262597\" width=616 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >踏上这场创意十足的谜题冒险，体验数十种游戏机制与数百小时的独特玩法。每一个谜题都承前启后，引入全新机制，回报你的好奇心与坚持。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/499170/extras/fcbaa6b2574a1c56b06bcf9cc4034a2e.poster.avif?t=1795262597\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/499170/extras/fcbaa6b2574a1c56b06bcf9cc4034a2e.webm?t=1795262597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/499170/extras/b4092baf94cec7f37e6c32ab39e5f224.avif?t=1795262597\" width=616 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索四个庞大而神秘的世界，每个世界都有专属的角色、规则、险境与待发掘的秘密。来去随心，按自己的节奏应对眼前的一切谜题。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/499170/extras/b6ee0437f3be077902bfe9a6ec0f8022.poster.avif?t=1795262597\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/499170/extras/b6ee0437f3be077902bfe9a6ec0f8022.webm?t=1795262597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/499170/extras/24659c38d702b2b31a82764ecde401f1.avif?t=1795262597\" width=616 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >女王、盗贼、战士、巫师、乃至一艘会说话的小船……都将是这段传奇的英雄。每位角色都拥有相辅相成的能力与引人入胜的故事。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/499170/extras/8f42bea0d7f9ac7203b868dba18ee640.poster.avif?t=1795262597\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/499170/extras/8f42bea0d7f9ac7203b868dba18ee640.webm?t=1795262597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/499170/extras/ab5748c3112b346fc2d9dd1c82eee9ed.avif?t=1795262597\" width=616 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >随着角色相遇、世界相互碰撞，谜团逐渐揭晓。通过谜题与收集散落的笔记，你将一步步深入了解这个神秘国度。借助每一条线索、每一片拼图，最终揭开《沉星之序》的终极秘密。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/499170/extras/68fb435f74af24c2a13b486dc967fd6c.poster.avif?t=1795262597\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/499170/extras/68fb435f74af24c2a13b486dc967fd6c.webm?t=1795262597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>历史、基础与设计贡献</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《沉星之序》自《The Witness》发布以来已酝酿近十年，源于一种渴望：将解谜游戏设计推过传统极限，创造出有史以来最大、最伟大的解谜游戏。通过《沉星之序》，开发团队创造了一个“游戏设计超级对撞机”——将多位解谜游戏设计师的想法碰撞在一起，创造出一个比以往更加复杂而广阔的解谜景观。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《沉星之序》的基础建立在以下四款杰出作品之上：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alan Hazelden 的《向孤寂家园掷石》（Skipping Stones to Lonely Homes）：一款宁静的解谜游戏，讲述向水中投掷石头以创造踏脚路径。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alan Hazelden 的《镜之群岛》（Mirror Isles）：一款巧妙的俯视角游戏，专注于在岛屿之间与倒影交换位置。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sean Barrett 的《誓言 1-3》（Promesst 1-3）：一款抽象网格解谜游戏，讲述探索一个充满神秘光束的洞穴。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jonah Ostroff 的《Heroes of Sokoban》（1、2、3）：一款奇幻主题解谜游戏，你管理不同的英雄职业（如战士和法师），利用独特的移动和推动机制到达出口。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >虽然这些游戏启发了《Order of the Sinking Star》，并构成了它的最初起点，奠定了其玩法基础，但整个游戏探索的是将这些世界融合在一起时无穷无尽、出乎意料的可能性。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏还展示了 Zach Polansky（《Enigmash》）、Patrick Traynor（《Patrick's Parabox》）、Marc ten Bosch（《Miegakure》）以及其他多人的设计贡献——包括多年来 Twitch 关注者的设计贡献。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thekla, Inc. 团队非常感谢大家在开发过程中对这款游戏的所有支持！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/499170/8e4b79f6886648fe2b9b4fd36824146559b047ec/header_schinese.jpg?t=1795262597","website":"https://www.orderofthesinkingstar.com/","developers":["Thekla, Inc."],"publishers":["Arc Games","Gamirror Games"],"release_date":"2026 年 10 月 8 日","coming_soon":false,"supported_languages":"英语<strong>*</strong>, 法语, 意大利语, 德语, 西班牙语 - 西班牙, 日语, 韩语, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西, 俄语, 简体中文, 繁体中文<br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","Steam 成就","完全支持控制器","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","Steam 云","家庭共享"],"genres":["冒险","独立","策略"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10 or later 64-bit (latest update)<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K or AMD Ryzen R5 1600 processor<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti or AMD Radeon RX 580 or Intel Arc A380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 12<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 14 GB 可用空间</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10 or later 64-bit (latest update)<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel Core i5-9600K or AMD Ryzen R5 3600 processor<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 2070 Ti or AMD Radeon RX 5700 or Intel Arc B570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 12<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 14 GB 可用空间</li></ul>"},"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/499170/44bbf392f454a49aa304917d30befad7f2bad8e3/ss_44bbf392f454a49aa304917d30befad7f2bad8e3.600x338.jpg?t=1795262597","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/499170/44bbf392f454a49aa304917d30befad7f2bad8e3/ss_44bbf392f454a49aa304917d30befad7f2bad8e3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795262597"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/499170/6227367e4defd4d5d43a852b43ff20994cb8cb32/ss_6227367e4defd4d5d43a852b43ff20994cb8cb32.600x338.jpg?t=1795262597","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/499170/6227367e4defd4d5d43a852b43ff20994cb8cb32/ss_6227367e4defd4d5d43a852b43ff20994cb8cb32.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795262597"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/499170/a6be2dd33d8b2e23237ac848d52c176623244abb/ss_a6be2dd33d8b2e23237ac848d52c176623244abb.600x338.jpg?t=1795262597","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/499170/a6be2dd33d8b2e23237ac848d52c176623244abb/ss_a6be2dd33d8b2e23237ac848d52c176623244abb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795262597"}],"price":{"currency":"JPY","initial":"3400.00","final":"2720.00","discount":20}}
